bottomparticipants

title Subsequence - React rating 1

control RatingLikeService
entity ":RatingLikeModel" as RatingLikeModel
entity ":RatingModel" as RatingModel
database MongoDB

RatingLikeService -> RatingLikeModel: 1. deleteOne(existing like)
activate RatingLikeModel
activate RatingLikeService
RatingLikeModel -> MongoDB: 2. Delete like
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> RatingLikeModel: 3. Delete result
RatingLikeModel --> RatingLikeService: 4. Return result
deactivate MongoDB
deactivate RatingLikeModel

RatingLikeService -> RatingModel: 5. Decrease likeCount
activate RatingModel
RatingModel -> MongoDB: 6. updateOne($inc -1)
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> RatingModel: 7. Update result
deactivate MongoDB
RatingModel --> RatingLikeService: 8. Return result
deactivate RatingModel

RatingLikeService -> RatingModel: 9. Get current likeCount
activate RatingModel
RatingModel -> MongoDB: 10. findById select likeCount
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> RatingModel: 11. Rating document
deactivate MongoDB
RatingModel --> RatingLikeService: 12. likeCount
deactivate RatingModel
deactivate RatingLikeService